sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GapCentralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapCentral]

    Note over App, Node: Allowed states: standby. Fire-and-forget, no response callback.<br>Should be called once during initialization before any connections are made.

    App->>Node: GapCentral.SetSecurityMode(<br>mode=mode1, level=authenticatedPairing)

    Note over App: If a connected peer does not meet the required level,<br>the connection will be rejected.
